 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They traveled through the island to Paphos town",
   "heard": 1,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Where a magician named Bar-Jesus was found",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "With the proconsul Sergius Paulus he stayed",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "An intelligent man in the ancient way",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He sent for Barnabas and Saul to come",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eager to hear the word of God in the room",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eager to hear the word of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sergius Paulus sought the living Lord",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the proconsul saw what had been done",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He believed in the light that was won",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Elymas the magician stood in the way",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Trying to turn the proconsul from the day",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He opposed them with his tricks of old",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seeking to stop the story to be told",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Saul filled with the Spirit looked at him straight",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And declared the judgment from God\u2019s own gate",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eager to hear the word of God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sergius Paulus sought the living Lord",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the proconsul saw what had been done",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He believed in the light that was won",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A mist and darkness came over his eyes",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He groped for hands in the surprise",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Twisting the straight paths of the Lord he tried",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the hand of the Lord was his guide",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eager to hear the word of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sergius Paulus sought the living Lord",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the proconsul saw what had been done",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He believed in the light that was won",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Astounded at the teaching of the Lord",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
